    {
      "voiceId": "jay-caspian-kang",
      "voiceName": "Jay Caspian Kang",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wemby really choked more in one series than any great player I can remember. Every fourth quarter was ass, throwing ball off teammate, missed free throws, stumbling around with the ball and tossing grenades to his teammates. Gotta cook him for it. Fair is fair.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/jaycaspiankang/status/2066011635081421090",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-14T04:15:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jay-caspian-kang",
      "voiceName": "Jay Caspian Kang",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Zohran please say you are a fan of Jay Kang so I can also win.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/jaycaspiankang/status/2066008709378302159",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-14T04:03:55+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jay-caspian-kang",
      "voiceName": "Jay Caspian Kang",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lotta blame for the spurs for days and they\u2019re a young team but I gotta wonder if their constant choking had something to do with the giant dude who couldn\u2019t control his emotions and kept screaming \u2018smash the escargot\u2019 every game",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/jaycaspiankang/status/2066005320363851841",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-14T03:50:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jay-caspian-kang",
      "voiceName": "Jay Caspian Kang",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Dolan\u2019s gonna bring out the Straight Shot and do his blues funk version of We are the Champions. Just go for it my little songbird you never wanted to own sports teams you just wanted to sing",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/jaycaspiankang/status/2066004103466267006",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-14T03:45:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jay-caspian-kang",
      "voiceName": "Jay Caspian Kang",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wemby went from esoteric dude who trained w the monks and did things we had never seen before on a basketball court to \u2018FUCK THAT FRENCH BITCH\u2019 in the course of a month. It\u2019s what makes America great lol.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/jaycaspiankang/status/2066002781115396155",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-14T03:40:22+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
